  "bodyHash": "ca8b271acc404b04",
  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 模組。用心打造。大量活躍的 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於此模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Tree Harvester 是一款可自訂設定的模組，允許你透過砍斷單一基礎方塊來瞬間採伐樹木、扭曲樹與巨型蘑菇。這可以是樹木的任何一部分。樹苗會自動根據樹木掉落物進行替換。模組內建多種檢查機制，從防止意外砍伐由原木搭建的房屋，到決定哪些樹葉會腐爛。<br><br>預設情況下，採伐功能僅在按住蹲下鍵時生效，但這可以在設定檔中切換。更多功能範例請見下方。模組提供豐富的設定選項，讓你完全依照喜好調整。<br><br>此模組為搭配我的 <a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ore-harvester\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ore Harvester</a> 模組而開發。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>預設設定下的功能特色：</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>所有樹木（包含原版與模組添加）均可透過蹲下並砍斷單一區塊快速採伐。<br><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>砍倒樹木所需的時間取決於其中的原木數量。<br><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>採伐樹木後，周圍的樹葉會迅速腐爛。<br><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>最後一片樹葉腐爛後，樹苗會自動替換。<br><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>下界的扭曲樹與緋紅樹可快速採伐。<br><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>巨型蘑菇同樣支援快速採伐。<br><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>可透過黑名單排除特定斧頭類型參與採伐。<br><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>多重判斷機制確保僅識別樹木，避免意外破壞房屋。<br><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>當兩種不同樹木相鄰時，僅會腐爛被砍斷的那種樹木的樹葉。<br><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>與其他模組相容。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"相依性\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/qol-bundle.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum&#x27;s QoL Bundle\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可自訂設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的設定選項：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>mustHoldAxeForTreeHarvest</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，僅當玩家主手持有斧頭時才能進行樹木採伐。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>treeHarvestWithoutSneak</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，不按住蹲下鍵即可採伐樹木。若停用則相反，僅在蹲下時生效。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>automaticallyFindBottomBlock</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">模組是否會嘗試尋找樹木實際的最底層原木作為起點。這意味著即使你在樹木中間砍斷它，它仍會被完整伐倒。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableFastLeafDecay</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，被砍伐樹木周圍的樹葉會迅速消失。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableNetherTrees</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，下界的扭曲樹與緋紅樹也將支援快速採伐。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableHugeMushrooms</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，大型/巨型蘑菇也將支援快速採伐。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>ignorePlayerMadeTrees</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，由玩家放置樹葉組成的樹木將不會被破壞。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>replaceSaplingOnTreeHarvest</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，採伐樹木時會自動使用掉落物替換樹苗。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>replaceMushroomOnMushroomHarvest</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，且在「enableHugeMushrooms」已啟用的情況下，採伐巨型蘑菇時會自動使用掉落物替換菌類。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>loseDurabilityPerHarvestedLog</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，每採伐一根原木，手持斧頭都會消耗耐久度。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>loseDurabilityModifier</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 1.0，最小 0.001，最大 1.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">在此可設定砍倒一棵樹應扣除斧頭多少耐久度。例如設為 0.1，表示每砍 10 根原木消耗 1 點耐久。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>increaseExhaustionPerHarvestedLog</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，玩家疲勞值會隨採伐原木增加。每根原木增加 0.005（Minecraft 原版每破壞方塊的預設值）* increaseExhaustionModifier。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>increaseExhaustionModifier</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 1.0，最小 0.001，最大 1.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">此設定決定每採伐一根原木應為玩家增加多少疲勞值。預設為 0.005 * 1.0。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>increaseHarvestingTimePerLog</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，採伐時間會隨著樹木中的原木數量增加。增加幅度由「increasedHarvestingTimePerLogModifier」決定。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>increasedHarvestingTimePerLogModifier</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 0.1，最小 0.01，最大 10.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">啟用「increaseHarvestingTimePerLog」後，採伐一棵樹會延長多少時間。實際速度計算公式為：newSpeed = originalSpeed / (1 + (logCount * increasedHarvestingTimePerLogModifier))。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>amountOfLeavesBrokenPerTick</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 3，最小 1，最大 16</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">樹木採伐後，每個遊戲刻（tick）應破壞多少片樹葉。提高此數值可加快樹葉腐爛速度，但會增加每刻的運算負載。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>斧頭黑名單功能：</strong></span><br>你可以設定僅允許特定斧頭進行樹木採伐。模組首次載入時會生成一份黑名單檔案，路徑位於 <strong><em>./config/treeharvester/harvestable_axe_blacklist.txt</em></strong>。此功能同樣適用於模組添加的斧頭物品。<br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/tree-harvester/blacklist.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>採伐與橡樹相鄰的白樺樹。僅白樺樹的樹葉會腐爛：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/tree-harvester/birch_only.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>一棵大型橡樹：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/tree-harvester/big_oak_only.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>一棵 2x2 雲杉樹。破樹時間較長，且全部 4 株樹苗皆正確替換：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/tree-harvester/big_spruce.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>適用於扭曲樹（下界樹木）：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/tree-harvester/nether_tree.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>同樣適用於巨型蘑菇，這裡是一朵棕色蘑菇：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/tree-harvester/brown_mushroom.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>以及一朵紅色蘑菇：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/tree-harvester/red_mushroom.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"注意事項與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>只要下載來源仍保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內，你可自由在任何整合包中使用此模組。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供所有模組的總覽與更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由於評論數量過多難以追蹤，因此已關閉評論功能。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>若有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，請前往 <a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 儲存庫</a>。感謝支持！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
